{"id":"espacio","lemma":"espacio","pos":"noun","rank":669,"glosses":["space (distance between things)","space (physical extent across two or three dimensions)","space (physical extent in all directions; the universe beyond the earth's atmosphere)"],"ipa":"/esˈpaθjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"espacios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-espacio.wav","formAudio":{"espacios":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-espacios.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Deja un espacio en blanco.","en":"Leave a blank space.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704174"},{"text":"Tom llenó los espacios.","en":"Tom filled in the blanks."},{"text":"Solo necesitaba algo de espacio.","en":"I just needed some space.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806470"},{"text":"La cama ocupa mucho espacio.","en":"The bed takes up a lot of room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/932206"},{"text":"¿Hay espacio para uno más?","en":"Is there space for one more person?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687716"}]}